. do ch11_tables.do 

. *============================================================================
> ==*
. * ch11_tables.do  --  Chapter 11: delivering through spreadsheets
. * The reproducible-reporting thesis made physical:
. *   (a) simulate a workforce program's participant earnings dataset,
. *   (b) estimate a simple earnings model by cohort,
. *   (c) write a booktabs-FREE LaTeX table fragment with -esttab-,
. *       which the book -\input-s directly (no hand editing), and
. *   (d) show the -putexcel- path that ships the same table to Excel.
. * The earnings data are SIMULATED with seed 20260704 (labeled so in text).
. *============================================================================
> ==*
. * Globals defined locally so this file runs standalone; in the full book
. * project they are set once by code/00_control.do instead.
. global root    "`c(pwd)'"

. global raw     "$root/raw"

. global clean   "$root/clean"

. global output  "$root/output"

. global figures "$root/figures"

. capture mkdir "$raw"

. capture mkdir "$clean"

. capture mkdir "$output"

. capture mkdir "$figures"

. 
. version 18

. clear all

. set more off

. set linesize 90

. 
. *--- (a) Simulate a workforce program's participant earnings ------------------*
. * 900 participants across three enrollment cohorts. Post-program quarterly
. * earnings rise with a training-hours dose and with prior work experience.
. set seed 20260704

. set obs 900
Number of observations (_N) was 0, now 900.

. gen id       = _n

. gen cohort   = 1 + mod(_n, 3)            // cohorts 1, 2, 3 (roughly equal)

. label define coh 1 "2022 cohort" 2 "2023 cohort" 3 "2024 cohort"

. label values cohort coh

. 
. gen female   = runiform() < 0.54

. gen exper    = max(0, round(rnormal(6, 4)))      // years of prior work

. gen hours    = round(20 + 60*runiform())         // training hours 20-80

. 
. * True data-generating process (dollars per quarter):
. gen earn = 3800 + 22*hours + 140*exper - 260*female ///
>            + 300*(cohort==2) + 640*(cohort==3) + rnormal(0, 900)

. replace earn = round(earn)
(900 real changes made)

. label var earn   "Quarterly earnings ($)"

. label var hours  "Training hours"

. label var exper  "Prior experience (yrs)"

. label var female "Female"

. 
. save "$clean/ch11_earnings.dta", replace
file /Users/ericbooth/Library/CloudStorage/GoogleDrive-eric.booth@texas2036.org/My
    Drive/Book-Manuscript-Applied-Evaluation-Stata/code/clean/ch11_earnings.dta saved

. 
