. *--- (d) The same numbers, shipped to Excel with -putexcel- (display path) ----*
. * This block writes a formatted one-tab workbook a funder opens in Excel.
. * Shown for reference; the .xlsx is a delivery artifact, not a book input.
. putexcel set "$output/ch11_earnings_summary.xlsx", replace
